# One proxy URL per line. spotdl 4.5.2's Downloader only accepts http(s) proxies with a
# literal IPv4 host (verified against the installed source — see CLAUDE.md v07 gotchas):
#   http://host:port
#   http://user:pass@host:port
# Hostnames and socks5:// are NOT accepted — spotdl raises DownloaderError for anything
# that doesn't match its IPv4 regex, which download_track then treats like any other
# failed attempt (cooldown, retried later).
#
# Blank lines and #-comments are ignored. Copy to proxies.txt (path configurable via the
# PROXY_FILE env var) and restart worker-meta to pick up changes — sync_from_file() runs
# once on worker-meta boot, adding new entries and disabling (not deleting) ones that were
# removed from the file so their health history survives a later re-add.
#
# UI management of this list is deferred to v13 — this plain file is the only interface
# for now.
